// BT-4033: a static Supervisor whose `withName:` child fails its `initialize`.

Supervisor subclass: Bt4033NamedSup

  childSpecs =>
    #((Bt4033Opener supervisionSpec withName: #bt4033_opener withArgs: #{
      #port => 1
    }))
